  "reviewFindings": [
    "ParseDetached schedules strict StudioBridgeJson.ParseSnapshot on Task.Run using an owned immutable response string and fresh result DTO; all parse exceptions are captured in the result.",
    "Transitive live parse path uses per-call JsonReader/JToken/serializer/settings/converters and normalizes only newly parsed DTOs. The shared schema JObject is read-only along the inspected path. No Unity API calls or diagnostic mutations are on that path. StudioSnapshotLoader is included for the exception definition only; its offline Unity-dependent loader is not invoked by live parsing.",
    "FetchSnapshot awaits task completion by yielding its coroutine, then records diagnostics and applies on main. SnapshotReadStillOwned gates generation, transport reference, runtime identity/replacement count, enabled state and terminal status before the original exact handshake join.",
    "Separate activeSnapshotRead ownership token releases only its own busy flag in finally despite generation invalidation. OnDisable invalidates generation; Start does not start new polling while disabled. Strict validation and torn-read/handshake join behavior remain intact.",
    "Projection-store application, subscriber work, and same-revision serialization remain on main. Detached parse alone does not establish a native frame-time pass."
  ],
